  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your channeling is especially powerful while visiting your faith’s wrath on your enemies and can cover an unusually large territory.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Channeling Scourge<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use channel energy to deal damage, add your mythic tier to your effective cleric levels for determining the number of damage dice and the saving throw DC. Additionally, you may expend one use of mythic power to increase the radius of that channel energy effect by 5 feet, plus 5 feet per 2 mythic tiers you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc59\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
